Only retained scalar source files are compiled (no NASM, external DLLs,
CMake or package-manager native libraries). src/native_symbols.h namespaces
all library symbols without editing upstream sources. Configuration headers
and public header copies are generated in Cargo's OUT_DIR. grainy-raw and
grainy-codecs link this single library through links = "grainy_jpeg".

cc (build dependency): MIT OR Apache-2.0.
grainy-testkit and ndarray are test-only workspace dependencies.
